// "... of Jolt" — TARGET-DEPENDENT CONDITIONAL (#109 B2b): MORE lightning damage
// WHILE THE VICTIM IS SHOCKED. The lightning member of the per-element vs-ailed trio
// (of_scorch / of_jolt / of_rime) — each boosts its own element against its own
// ailment, folded per-victim in `World::strike`. First-pass magnitudes (playtest redline).
AffixDef(
    id: "of_jolt",
    public: true,
    name: "of Jolt",
    kind: suffix,
    weight: 30,
    effects: [(stat: damage_lightning, layer: more, condition: Some(target_has_ailment(shock)))],
    tiers: [
        (ilvl: 4, name: "of Jolt", weight: 100, rolls: [(min: 1000, max: 2000)]),       // +10-20% more
        (ilvl: 12, name: "of Electrocution", weight: 40, rolls: [(min: 2001, max: 3000)]), // +20-30% more
    ],
)
